    "title": "Legal & Finance approve the budget for Mental Health Support - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kennedy Leara ,\n19 hours ago RAPID CITY, S.D. (KOTA) - Legal and Finance was at Rapid City Hall today to approve the budget for local groups to help address the mental health crisis in the community. These programs help someone you know who is going through a rough time to get the help they need from an expert besides the police. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
